armbian-firstrun-gui (0.1.1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Keep the desktop after a successful setup: start tty1 only on failure.
  * Show the IP address in the header.
  * Choose the shell: bash or zsh.
  * Setup page: a progress bar. The log shows after a failure.

